      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Neoplasia and hyperplasia of the temporomandibular joint-related connective tissue are among the rare causes of disc displacement and temporomandibular joint (TMJ) dysfunction. Here we present an unusual case of hyperplasia of the glenoid fossa, treated for TMJ dysfunction."},
